@sheet Orders
@header | Customer | Units |
@defaults | "Pending" | 1 |
| Ada | 2 |
| Luis | 3 |
| | |

@sheet Report
@header | Metric | Value |
| First units | =Orders!Units[2] |
| First-sheet units | =!!Units[3] |
| Customer count | =COUNTA(Orders!Customer) |
| Numeric count | =COUNT(Orders!Customer) |
| Unit total | =SUM(Orders!Units)[$][2d] |
